### Configure and set data for a Candlestick Series in Lightweight Charts

Source: https://github.com/tradingview/lightweight-charts/blob/master/website/tutorials/customization/assets/step10.html

This snippet shows how to add a Candlestick Series to a Lightweight Charts instance, set its initial data, and then apply custom color options for the wick and body of both up and down candles. It requires an existing 'chart' instance and 'candleStickData'.

```javascript
// Create the Main Series (Candlesticks)
